FT                   /note="Domain:cl17037:NBD_sugar-kinase_HSP70_actin
FT                   Nucleotide-Binding Domain of the sugar kinase/HSP70/actin
FT                   superfamily. FtsA is essential for bacterial cell division,
FT                   and co-localizes to the septal ring with FtsZ. It has been
FT                   suggested that the interaction of FtsA-FtsZ has arisen
FT                   through coevolution in different bacterial strains. The
FT                   FtsA protein contains two structurally related actin-like
FT                   ATPase domains which are also structurally related to the
FT                   ATPase domains of HSP70 (see PF00012). FtsA has a SHS2
FT                   domain PF02491 inserted in to the RnaseH fold PF02491.
FT                   [Superfamily, Aligned:4-235, Eval:3.7e-40, score:135.9]"
