FT                   /note="Domain:cl11393:Peptidase_M14_like M14 family of
FT                   metallocarboxypeptidases and related proteins. This is the
FT                   peptidase domain of a D,L-carboxypeptidase. The active site
FT                   residues are Arg86, Glu222 and the metal ligands, in the
FT                   peptidase domain, are Gln46, Glu49 and His128 in
FT                   UniProtKB:O25708. The protein binds many zinc ions and a
FT                   calcium ion and there are other metal binding sites. The
FT                   catalytic activity is the release of m-Dpm from the peptide
FT                   muramyl-Ala-gamma-D-Glu-m-Dpm; this is probably the
