FT                   /note="Domain:cl26291:HTH_18 Helix-turn-helix domain.
FT                   Bacteria whose genomes encode only one protein with the
FT                   YSIRK variant form of signal peptide (TIGR01168) were
FT                   examined for conserved genes near that one tagged protein.
FT                   This protein is found adjacent to at various classes of
FT                   repetitive or low-complexity YSIRK proteins (whether unique
FT                   in genome or not), in a range of species (Enterococcus
FT                   faecalis X98, Ruminococcus torques, Coprobacillus sp. D7,
FT                   Lysinibacillus fusiformis ZC1, Streptococcus equi subsp.
FT                   equi 4047, etc). The affliated YSIRK proteins include
FT                   Streptococcal protective antigen (see ) and proteins with
FT                   the Rib/alpha/Esp surface antigen repeat (see TIGR02331).
FT                   The last quarter of this protein has an AraC family
FT                   helix-turn-helix (HTH)transcriptional regulator domain.
FT                   [Superfamily, Aligned:156-284, Eval:2.1e-35, score:127.0,
FT                   N-term missing]"
