FT                   /note="Domain:cl01251:OHCU_decarbox OHCU decarboxylase.
FT                   Previously thought to only proceed spontaneously, the
FT                   decarboxylation of
FT                   2-oxo-4-hydroxy-4-carboxy--5-ureidoimidazoline (OHCU) has
FT                   been recently been shown to be catalyzed by this enzyme in
FT                   Mus musculus. Homologs of this enzyme are found adjacent to
FT                   and fused with uricase in a number of prokaryotes and are
FT                   represented by this model. This model is a separate (but
FT                   related) clade from that represented by TIGR3164. This
FT                   model places a second homolog in streptomyces species which
FT                   (are not in the vicinity of other urate catabolism
