FT                   membrane to the reversible transfer of hydride ion
FT                   equivalents between NAD and NADP. An alternate name is
FT                   pyridine nucleotide transhydrogenase alpha subunit. The
FT                   N-terminal region is homologous to alanine dehydrogenase.
