FT                   /note="Domain:cl02526:Peptidase_S41 C-terminal processing
FT                   peptidase family S41. This model describes a multidomain
FT                   protein of about 1070 residues, restricted to the order
FT                   Myxococcales in the Deltaproteobacteria. Members contain a
FT                   PDZ domain (pfam00595), an S41 family peptidase domain
FT                   (pfam03572), and an SH3 domain (pfam06347). A core region
FT                   of this family, including PDZ and S41 regions, is described
FT                   by TIGR00225, C-terminal processing peptidase, which
FT                   recognizes the Prc protease. The species distribution of
FT                   this family approximates that of largely
FT                   Deltaproteobacterial C-terminal putative protein-sorting
FT                   domain, TIGR03901, analogous to LPXTG and PEP-CTERM, but
FT                   the co-occurrence may reflect shared restriction to the
FT                   Myxococcales rather than a substrate/target relationship.
FT                   [Superfamily, Aligned:47-389, Eval:1.2e-74, score:234.9]"
