FT                   methyltransferases. This family is based on the
FT                   phylogenomic analysis of JA Eisen (1999, Ph.D. Thesis,
FT                   Stanford University). The DNA adenine methylase (dam) of E.
FT                   coli and related species is instrumental in distinguishing
FT                   the newly synthesized strand during DNA replication for
FT                   methylation-directed mismatch repair. This family includes
