FT                   /note="Domain:cl09190:MAPEG MAPEG family. This family is
FT                   has been called MAPEG (Membrane Associated Proteins in
FT                   Eicosanoid and Glutathione metabolism). It includes
FT                   proteins such as Prostaglandin E synthase. This enzyme
FT                   catalyzes the synthesis of PGE2 from PGH2 (produced by
FT                   cyclooxygenase from arachidonic acid). Because of
FT                   structural similarities in the active sites of FLAP, LTC4
