FT                   /note="Domain:cl00596:LrgB LrgB-like family. Members of
FT                   this small but broadly distibuted (Gram-positive,
FT                   Gram-negative, and Archaeal) family appear to have multiple
FT                   transmembrane segments. The function is unknown. A homolog,
FT                   LrgB of Staphylococcus aureus, in the same small
FT                   superfamily but in an outgroup to this subfamily, is
FT                   regulated by LytSR and is suggested to act as a murein
