FT                   /note="Domain:cl23863:BrnA_antitoxin BrnA antitoxin of type
FT                   II toxin-antitoxin system. CopG antitoxin is a member of a
FT                   type II toxin-antitoxin system family found in bacteria and
FT                   archaea. Most antitoxins encoded by the relBE and parDE
FT                   loci belong to the MetJ/Arc/CopG family of dimeric proteins
FT                   which bind DNA through N-terminal ribbon-helix-helix (RHH)
FT                   motifs. The toxin for CopG proteins falls into the family
